# lib_playground, a library of ix's tools (mkfiles/mklib): Elm's
# architecture (core/: Cmd, Sub...), the shapes (Playground) and the
# layers (camera, sprites, tiles). Its other parts are libraries of
# their own, each built after the ones it stands on: random/ (Lehmer,
# which lib_playground stands on), juice/ (over nothing), physics/ (after lib_graphics), apis/ (after
# physics/, lib_gui, lib_audio, juice/, netcode, ai/), platforms/ and
# each platform (platforms/ppm...).
TOP=..
<$TOP/mkfiles/mkconfig
LIB=lib_playground
DIRS=core . layers
NEEDS=lib_graphics lib_playground/random
UNITS=Basics Cmd Color Set Time Audio_source Sub Playground Camera2d Scene2d Sprite Tilemap
<$TOP/mkfiles/mklib
